@Attendance.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5163

### 1. Health Check
GET {{Attendance.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### 2. Bulk Attendance Ingestion
POST {{Attendance.Api_HostAddress}}/api/attendance/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schoolId": 1,
  "records": [
    {
      "studentId": "STU-001",
      "attendDate": "2026-09-04",
      "attendanceCode": "P",
      "minutesLate": 0,
      "notes": "Present"
    },
    {
      "studentId": "STU-002",
      "attendDate": "2026-09-04",
      "attendanceCode": "A",
      "minutesLate": 0,
      "notes": "Absent"
    }
  ]
}